stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Single UAN, active for filing" as SINGLE
    state "Further UAN declared, active one unconfirmed" as DECLARED
    state "Active UAN confirmed by a distinct checker" as CONFIRMED
    state "Member's EPFO-side outcome recorded" as RESOLVED
    state "A submitted or filed line used another UAN" as WRONG

    [*] --> SINGLE: MU1 linked at joining or carried by migration
    SINGLE --> DECLARED: MU2 employee, HR, import or operator declares another UAN
    DECLARED --> CONFIRMED: MU3 active UAN proposed with evidence and checked
    CONFIRMED --> RESOLVED: MU4 evidence of the member's outcome attached
    RESOLVED --> SINGLE: MU5 exactly one UAN remains active, others kept as history
    SINGLE --> WRONG: MU6 evidence a line credited the wrong UAN
    CONFIRMED --> WRONG: MU6 the same, found after confirmation
    WRONG --> CONFIRMED: MU7 route decided and recorded per affected month

    note right of DECLARED
        Payroll runs. The ECR for each period
        reads the UAN active in that period.
        MULTIPLE_UAN_DECLARED stays on the
        readiness report until MU4.
    end note

    note right of WRONG
        An approved return is never cancelled.
        Revised only before payment initiation.
        The product never creates, merges
        or retires a UAN.
    end note
